iv*stride form and GCC. nbody's remaining imulq are preheader pointer-init
computations for non-constant IV inits (a separate, lower-value optimization).

Correctness: regression 127/127, correctness 50/50, intrinsics 3/3, 14
benchmarks bit-exact vs gcc.
